"\n"
"Disables automatic filling of the project field based on previous\n"
"entries on timesheets.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"The feature provided by this module is enabled automatically after\n"
"installation, with no further steps required.\n"
"\n"
"By default, when adding a new line in a timesheet, the system will\n"
"autofill the Project field with a project used in at least three of the\n"
"employee's last five entries, as shown below:\n"
"\n"
"|Project autofill enabled after three entries on the same project|\n"
"\n"
"|Project autofill enabled with three of the last five entries on the\n"
"same project|\n"
"\n"
"With this module installed, this behaviour is disabled and the Project\n"
"field must be selected manually each time, regardless of previous\n"
"selections, as shown below:\n"
"\n"
"|Project autofill disabled after three entries on the same project|\n"
"\n"
"|Project autofill disabled with three of the last five entries on the\n"
"same project|\n"
"\n"
"Only the autofill based on previous entries is disabled. Default\n"
"projects set in other ways, such as a default value set by an\n"
"administrator, are still applied.\n"
"\n"
".. |Project autofill enabled after three entries on the same project| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OCA/timesheet/20.0/hr_timesheet_autofill_project_off/static/img/01a_project_autofill_without_addon.png\n"
".. |Project autofill enabled with three of the last five entries on the same project| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OCA/timesheet/20.0/hr_timesheet_autofill_project_off/static/img/01b_project_autofill_without_addon.png\n"
".. |Project autofill disabled after three entries on the same project| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OCA/timesheet/20.0/hr_timesheet_autofill_project_off/static/img/02a_no_project_autofill_with_addon.png\n"
".. |Project autofill disabled with three of the last five entries on the same project| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OCA/timesheet/20.0/hr_timesheet_autofill_project_off/static/img/02b_no_project_autofill_with_addon.png\n"
"\n"
